<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
<%- include('partials/header') %>

<main id="main">
  <section class="tx-index-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">Privacy</span>
      </nav>
      <span class="eyebrow">Your Information</span>
      <h1>Privacy and appointment policy</h1>
      <svg class="smile-arc" viewBox="0 0 64 16"><path d="M4 4 Q32 18 60 4"/></svg>
      <p class="tx-index-lede">What <%= clinic.name %> collects through this website, why, and what it is never used for.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-pad" style="padding-top:0;">
    <div class="wrap prose">

      <h2>What this website collects</h2>
      <p>Only what is needed to arrange your visit. When you book an appointment or request a
      call back, the clinic records your name, mobile number, an email address if you give one,
      the treatment you selected, and anything you type in the message box.</p>
      <p>The website does not ask for, and you should not send through it, details of your medical
      history, medication or diagnosis. Bring those to your appointment or discuss them on the phone.</p>

      <h2>What it is used for</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Holding the appointment slot you chose, and confirming it.</li>
        <li>Sending you a reminder before your appointment, if the clinic has that enabled.</li>
        <li>Calling or messaging you back when you ask for it.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Your details are not sold, and are not passed to anyone for advertising. They are visible
      to <%= clinic.doctor || 'the dentist' %> and clinic staff, who need them to run your appointment.</p>

      <h2>Messages on WhatsApp</h2>
      <p>If you contact the clinic on WhatsApp, or the clinic messages you there, that conversation
      also passes through WhatsApp under its own terms. Appointment confirmations and reminders
      carry only your name, the date, the time and the treatment — never clinical detail.</p>

      <h2>Photographs</h2>
      <p>Photographs of patients or of treatment results are only published on this website with
      the patient's explicit consent, recorded at the time. The same applies to any testimonial
      that carries a patient's name. Consent can be withdrawn at any time by telling the clinic,
      and the photograph or testimonial is then removed.</p>

      <h2>Cancelling or changing an appointment</h2>
      <p>Your confirmation carries a booking reference. You can cancel online using that reference
      together with the mobile number you booked with, or simply call or message the clinic.
      Letting the clinic know early frees the slot for another patient.</p>
      <p>The clinic holds your booked time for you. If you cannot make it, a message beforehand is
      appreciated — it is the only way another patient can use the time.</p>

      <h2>How long information is kept</h2>
      <p>Appointment and patient records are kept as part of the clinic's ordinary dental records.
      A call-back request that does not lead to an appointment is kept only while it is being
      followed up.</p>

      <h2>Asking about your information</h2>
      <p>To ask what the clinic holds about you, to correct it, or to ask for it to be removed,
      contact <%= clinic.name %>:</p>
      <ul>
        <% if (clinic.phone) { %><li>Phone: <a class="mono" href="tel:<%= clinic.phone_intl || clinic.phone %>"><%= clinic.phone %></a></li><% } %>
        <% if (clinic.email) { %><li>Email: <a href="mailto:<%= clinic.email %>"><%= clinic.email %></a></li><% } %>
        <li>In person: <%= clinic.address %></li>
      </ul>

      <p class="prose-note">Last updated <%= updatedAt %>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
<script src="/js/site.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
